= Integer Quantum Hall Effect

Now we're prepared to discuss the integer quantum Hall effect (IQHE).
The IQHE is a quantum phenomenon observed in two-dimensional electron
systems subjected to low temperatures and strong magnetic fields.

== Standard QHE

The standard IQHE occurs in a two-dimensional electron gas (2DEG)
confined to a plane and subjected to a perpendicular magnetic field.
This section we will discuss the explanation of IQHE in this
framework.

